    "answer": {
      "short": "$p^{\\frac{8}{3}}$. Correct answer: D.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(A\\mid B)&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(B)}\\\\p&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{p^2}\\\\P(A\\cap B)&=p^3\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(A)}\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=\\frac{p^3}{p^{\\frac13}}\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=p^{3-\\frac13}\\\\P(B\\mid A)&=p^{\\frac83}\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect answer: D.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
